hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1766","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba ne Banu Uqail mein se ek aadmi ko qaidi bana liya, jabke Saqeef walon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se do aadmiyon ko qaidi banaya tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is ko in do aadmiyon ke badle mein diya jin ko Saqeef walon ne qaid kiya tha."
"1767","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba kiram ne Banu Aqeel ke ek aadmi ko qaidi bana liya, to unhon ne is ko rasiyon se bandh kar Harrah mein phaink diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is ke paas se guzre aur ham Aap ke sath the, ya farmaya: Is ke paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) gadhe par sawar ho kar aae aur is ke neeche ek kambal tha. Us ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko 'Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad!' kah kar awaz di. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is ke paas aae aur poocha: 'Kya shan hai?' Us ne kaha: 'Mujhe kis jurm mein giraftar kiya gaya hai? Aur hajiyon ki aage chalne wali oontni ko kis qasoor mein pakda hai?' Farmaya: 'Tumhare haleef Saqeef ke iqdamat ki wajah se giraftar hui.' Aur Saqeef ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke do Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko giraftar kiya tha. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use chhoda aur chale gae. To us ne dobara pukara: 'Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad!' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is par shafqat ki aur is ki taraf laute aur poocha: 'Kya shan hai?' Us ne kaha: 'Main Musalman hun.' Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar tu yeh baat is waqt kahta jab tu apne mamle ka malik tha to tu poori tarah kamyab ho jata.' Phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use chhoda aur chale gae, us ne phir pukara: 'Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad!' Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) phir is ki taraf laute to us ne kaha: 'Main bhooka hun, mujhe khilaie'. Rawi kahte hain, mera khayal hai us ne yeh bhi kaha: 'Aur main pyasa hun, mujhe pani pilaie'. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh teri zaroorat hai.' Phir use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in do aadmiyon ke badle chhod diya jin ko Saqeef walon ne qaidi banaya tha, aur apni oontni bhi le li."
"1768","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko do aadmiyon ke badle mein diya."
"1769","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Yaman walon ki taraf likha ke tum mein se har insan par har saal ek deenar hai ya is ki qeemat ke Mu'afir kapde dena hain."
"1770","[AI-translation] Mujhe Mutarrif bin Mazin aur Hisham bin Yusuf ne khabar di, unhon ne musnad bayan ki lekin main yaad nahin rakh saka albatta woh sanad hasan hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Yaman ke Zimmiyon par har saal ek deenar farz ki. Main ne Mutarrif bin Mazin se poocha: 'Yeh baat kahi jati hai ke aurton par bhi hai?' To Mutarrif ne kaha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurton se jizya liya ho, in ke han yeh baat sabit shuda nahin hai."
"1771","[AI-translation] Abu Huwairis se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah mein Mauhab Eisai par ek deenar salana lagaya, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ailah ke Eisaiyon par salana 300 deenar lagaya aur unhen hukm diya ke jo Musalman in ke paas se guzre is ki teen din tak ziyafat karen aur kisi Musalman se dhoka na karen."
"1772","[AI-translation] Ishaq bin Abdullah ne bayan farmaya ke woh is waqt 300 ki tadad mein the, is liye Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in par salana 300 deenar muqarrar kiye."
"1773","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad ne apne baap se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Majoos ka zikr kiya to farmaya: 'Main nahin janta ke in ke mamle mein kya karun.' To Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne in se kaha: 'Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farma rahe the: In ke sath wahi tareeqa barto jo tum Ahl Kitab se bartte ho.'"
"1774","[AI-translation] Bajalah farmate hain ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Majoosiyon se jizya nahin liya yahan tak ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne gawahi di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajar ke Majoosiyon se jizya liya tha."
"1775","[AI-translation] Nasr bin Aasim ne bayan kiya ke Farwah bin Naufal Ashja'i ne kaha: 'Majoosiyon se jizya kyun liya jata hai, woh Ahl Kitab nahin hain.' Yeh sun kar in ki taraf Mustawrid khade hue aur unhen gireban se pakad kar kaha: 'Aey Allah ke dushman! Tu Abu Bakr, Umar aur Ameerul Momineen yani Ali (Raziyallahu anhum) par ta'n karta hai, jabke unhon ne in Majoosiyon se jizya liya hai.' Phir unhen qasr ki taraf le gae, to Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) bahar tashreef lae aur farmaya: 'Tum donon narmi barto.' To woh donon mahal ke sae mein baith gae. Phir Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Main logon mein se sab se zyada Majoosiyon ke bare mein janne wala hun. In Majoosiyon ke paas ilm tha jise woh jante the, aur ek kitab thi jise woh padhte the. Hua yun ke in ka badshah nashe mein dhut ho gaya to us ne apni beti ya apni bahan se zina kar liya, is baat ka pata is ki badshahat ke kuch sardar afrad ko laga. Jab woh bedar hua aur log is par hadd nafiz karne ke liye aae to us ne in ko roka aur apni mamlakat ke sardar afrad ko bula kar kaha: Kya tum Adam Alaihissalam ke deen se behtar koi deen jante ho? Adam Alaihissalam to apne beton ka apni betiyon se nikah kar dete the, aur main bhi to Adam Alaihissalam ke deen par hun, tum in ke deen se kyun door ho? Phir in logon ne is ki ittiba ki aur apne mukhalifeen ke sath qital kiya yahan tak ke in ko qatl kar diya. Phir in ki haalat yeh ho gai ke in ki kitab par pahre bitha diye gae. Phir woh in se utha li gai, aur in ke seenon se ilm khatm ho gaya, aur woh Ahl Kitab mein se hain. Aur in se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne jizya liya hai.'"
